{"all_articles":[{"anchors":["definition"],"bibliography":[],"english_title":"Limit","external_links":[],"html":"<p><a id=\"definition\"></a></p>\n<p>对实数数列（real sequence）<span class=\"math inline\">(a_n)</span>，若对每个 <span class=\"math inline\">\\varepsilon&gt;0</span>，存在整数 <span class=\"math inline\">N</span>，使得 <span class=\"math inline\">n\\ge N</span> 时 <span class=\"math inline\">|a_n-L|&lt;\\varepsilon</span>，则称 <span class=\"math inline\">a_n</span> 收敛（converges）到极限（limit）<span class=\"math inline\">L</span>，记为 <span class=\"math inline\">\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}a_n=L</span>。对实函数 <span class=\"math inline\">f</span>，若对每个 <span class=\"math inline\">\\varepsilon&gt;0</span>，存在 <span class=\"math inline\">\\delta&gt;0</span>，使得定义域中 <span class=\"math inline\">0&lt;|x-a|&lt;\\delta</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math inline\">|f(x)-L|&lt;\\varepsilon</span>，则记 <span class=\"math inline\">\\lim_{x\\to a}f(x)=L</span>。</p>\n<h2>术语对照 / Terminology</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>中文</th>\n<th>English</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>函数</td>\n<td>function</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>定义域</td>\n<td>domain</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实数</td>\n<td>real number</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>收敛</td>\n<td>convergence</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>极限</td>\n<td>limit</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n","id":"calc.limit.main","legacy":true,"node_id":"calc.limit","resources":[],"schema_version":1,"title":"极限"}],"anchors":["definition"],"articles":[{"anchors":["definition"],"bibliography":[],"english_title":"Limit","external_links":[],"html":"<p><a id=\"definition\"></a></p>\n<p>对实数数列（real sequence）<span class=\"math inline\">(a_n)</span>，若对每个 <span class=\"math inline\">\\varepsilon&gt;0</span>，存在整数 <span class=\"math inline\">N</span>，使得 <span class=\"math inline\">n\\ge N</span> 时 <span class=\"math inline\">|a_n-L|&lt;\\varepsilon</span>，则称 <span class=\"math inline\">a_n</span> 收敛（converges）到极限（limit）<span class=\"math inline\">L</span>，记为 <span class=\"math inline\">\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}a_n=L</span>。